            /** @description Slots this file changed rather than created. Re-uploading a file with a corrected room or lead is how a timetable is edited in bulk; a slot whose start time moved does not match and arrives as a second slot instead, with the original reported in not_in_file. */
            slots_corrected?: number;
            /** @description Days already generated from a corrected slot that were still plans and now carry the new lead and room. A day whose room changed also has its geofence cleared, because the old one fenced members out of the room they have just been sent to. */
